id: desperate-distraction
name: Desperate Distraction
talentCategory: skill
prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff and 2+ Skill Ranks in Intuition
description: >
  You can read your opponents and skillfully deceive them into creating an opening for you to fight back!
text: >
  Desperate Distraction: You can read your opponents and skillfully deceive them into creating an opening for you to fight back!
  –Prerequisites: 2+ Skill Ranks in Bluff and 2+ Skill Ranks in Intuition
  (1)-[Passive]: You gain access to the Dirty Trick Maneuver.
  (2)-[1/Round]: If you are below the Injured Health Threshold, you may use the Dirty Trick Maneuver as an Instant Maneuver.

---

[passive]
# (1)
allow maneuver.dirty-trick;
# (2) Below Injured - Injured or Critical: the Dirty Trick's own Instant button on the Maneuvers tab, once a Round
# (actor-character-sheet.mjs _onDesperateInstant).
if (belowThreshold("injured")) {
    allow dirtyTrick.desperateInstant;
}
